    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Awaits You:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Art of Blending</strong> \u2013 Mix different tobaccos, choose the right coals, and experiment with flavors to create unique taste experiences.<br><strong>Control the quality of the hookah:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/b74117c973b8cc4c088c1596c976083d.poster.avif?t=1754433291\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/b74117c973b8cc4c088c1596c976083d.webm?t=1754433291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/b74117c973b8cc4c088c1596c976083d.mp4?t=1754433291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Growth</strong> \u2013 Expand your venue, buy new furniture, give it a stylish makeover, and attract more customers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/06192703cdf95bcbecd8b89cbf16fa12.poster.avif?t=1754433291\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/06192703cdf95bcbecd8b89cbf16fa12.webm?t=1754433291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/06192703cdf95bcbecd8b89cbf16fa12.mp4?t=1754433291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Clientele</strong> \u2013 Every guest has their own personality and preferences: some enjoy strong, rich smoke, while others prefer light, fruity notes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation &amp; Fame</strong> \u2013 Improve your service, fulfill special requests, and become a legend in the hookah world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/7caece5b84103f93a97ce2b0722708f0.poster.avif?t=1754433291\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/7caece5b84103f93a97ce2b0722708f0.webm?t=1754433291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768690/extras/7caece5b84103f93a97ce2b0722708f0.mp4?t=1754433291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;From the first ember\u2014to worldwide recognition!&quot;</i></p>",
